    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "18. Transports",
    "ruleNumber": "18.04.01",
    "summary": "After its TRANSPORT made an Ingress move, a unit that disembarks in rapid disembark mode has its models bound by every rule and restriction that bound that TRANSPORT. For instance, if the TRANSPORT's placement had to be over 8\" from every enemy unit and outside the enemy player's deployment zone, the disembarking unit must meet both conditions too.",
